OL,3,GNEWSATrain attacker said 'You're all   
OL,4,Agoing to die today'                    
OL,6,FA knifeman accused of trying to kill   
OL,7,Fpeople on a train said "you're all     
OL,8,Fgoing to die" and "I'm not going to    
OL,9,Fleave anyone", a jury has heard.       
OL,11,FAnthony Williams denies 10 counts of   
OL,12,Fattempted murder on a Doncaster to     
OL,13,FLondon King's Cross service which had  
OL,14,Fto make an unscheduled stop at         
OL,15,FHuntingdon in Cambridgeshire on 1      
OL,16,FNovember last year.                    
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
