OL,3,GNEWSATrain attacker said 'You're all   
OL,4,Agoing to die today'                    
OL,6,FIn a closing speech, prosecutor        
OL,7,FChristopher Paxton KC told Cambridge   
OL,8,FCrown Court Williams had "deadly       
OL,9,Fintention", adding: "The fists and feet
OL,10,Fof this big powerful man as he was     
OL,11,Fdescribed were not weapons enough."    
OL,13,FWilliams, 33, of Langford Road,        
OL,14,FPeterborough, also denies four counts  
OL,15,Fof attempted murder in relation to     
OL,16,Fearlier attacks in his home city and   
OL,17,FLondon.                                
